41383::$$$message_0289_0000_0000$$$::"These are extra variations for Archer's new standing illustration."::
41384::$$$message_0289_0001_0000$$$::"By the time we added his personal clothes (right), production was mostly finished."::
41385::$$$message_0289_0002_0000$$$::"I'm fond of sleeveless (center), too."::
41386::$$$message_0289_0003_0000$$$::"Hmm, yeah.[br]The character artist says, 'intimidated by the way he just walks around town not caring what people think, we made it in a rush.'"::
41387::$$$message_0289_0004_0000$$$::"Well, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][font italic=true]I[font italic=false] like it!":’‘©